  },
  {
   "id": "t_547b0035a15a7a1c3a64",
   "sourceHash": "547b0035a15a7a1c3a642a6704105684acce64fb0e461f4dc8b47a48f63a89d0",
   "text": "Kairali — The Ayurvedic Healing Village · 始于1908年",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8ecfe1ae17f1a168f778",
   "sourceHash": "8ecfe1ae17f1a168f778b0d95fd5b032f1c95aa317b425da1a37fe9cd2d87aff",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]自1999年起荣膺“亚洲最佳阿育吠陀疗养地”[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]位于喀拉拉邦帕拉卡德的Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village是一处独一无二的整体疗愈空间，以传统、正宗的阿育吠陀疗法由内而外地调理身心。[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Retreat' in the award-style heading rendered as 疗养地 (not a banned-word equivalent); please confirm the exact award title wording if an official Chinese title exists."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9fe7b21fbef9dc098dfd",
   "sourceHash": "9fe7b21fbef9dc098dfd65bdbd69adbff8f92de9b10eda1cdc8c6e3c860724e1",
   "text": "K.V. Ramesh的一封信",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_713231a2352ca5c027f4",
   "sourceHash": "713231a2352ca5c027f43da7de4bf77edbcc4d2a2e761c28729d8da4ce976187",
   "text": "亲爱的患者与来访者：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned word 'Guests' replaced with 患者与来访者 (patients and visitors) per KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8efc98596483557860c2",
   "sourceHash": "8efc98596483557860c293122024bcee512787b8ff96d24fe65b3cf30693f384",
   "text": "欢迎来到Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village——在这里，阿育吠陀永恒的智慧与当代生活的需求相融合。我非常荣幸与您分享Kairali的核心价值：致力于身心整体健康、正宗的阿育吠陀疗法，以及人类的福祉与进步。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a3be5970ca7bc2c6d421",
   "sourceHash": "a3be5970ca7bc2c6d421f9e3962a192c0c09cb208fb7e40077ed6cb92d9f8c85",
   "text": "我对Kairali Ayurvedic Group的愿景始终牢牢植根于古老的阿育吠陀科学，我认为它是通往身心和谐与健康的最佳途径。我成长于一个浸润在阿育吠陀传统中的家庭，亲眼见证了它对人们生活的深远影响。这激励我将毕生精力投入到守护这份珍贵遗产、并将其介绍给世界的事业之中。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b134fc35db6938fdccd",
   "sourceHash": "4b134fc35db6938fdccdfd52ca938473ead058224078795a7d7b433e18ba4396",
   "text": "正宗与卓越始终是Kairali的基石，这一理念也体现在Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village之中。从各项疗法与治疗，到宁静、环保的环境，这里的每一个细节都经过精心规划，旨在提供全面沉浸式的阿育吠陀体验。在这里，我们将传统习俗与现代接待服务标准相结合，营造一处让来访者得以寻得宁静、焕新与平衡的疗愈之所。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'retreat' rendered as 这里 / 疗愈之所 to stay in the clinical register; 'hospitality standards' rendered as 接待服务标准."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b0f7e500146966f97b04",
   "sourceHash": "b0f7e500146966f97b0496ce1737353b90437144ccda33ea4a2b8e429ce54b5a",
   "text": "我们的目标不仅是提供阿育吠陀护理，更是倡导一种重视心理、精神与身体健康的生活方式。我们希望通过个性化疗法、治疗性饮食、瑜伽课程和冥想练习，帮助患者与来访者过上更好、更充实的生活。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned word 'guests' replaced with 患者与来访者 (patients and visitors) per KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4e2d1947f02a5d1251bf",
   "sourceHash": "4e2d1947f02a5d1251bf72fc6bfffedc41277838c33417075e62e8f82fa6e776",
   "text": "多年来，Kairali Ayurvedic Group已成长为享誉全球的品牌，但我们的原则始终如一。我们在此担当阿育吠陀的守护者，将其疗愈益处带给有需要的人，同时坚守正直诚信——正是这份坚守，使我们成为整体健康领域公认的权威之一。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_00033cfb22b3b01328c3",
   "sourceHash": "00033cfb22b3b01328c3593efadf2e525cee8048d1ea05cf7bbb9752807d0268",
   "text": "我向每一位来到Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village的朋友致以衷心的感谢。您对阿育吠陀和Kairali的信任，激励着我们不断创新与进步。诚邀您在阿育吠陀永恒原则的指引下，踏上这段自我发现、疗愈与焕新的转变历程。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned word 'journey' replaced with 历程 (process/path) rather than 旅程 per KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f3a919feaaac058f8c4e",
   "sourceHash": "f3a919feaaac058f8c4e8666acae92501ac7bd1d2baee4aa77b826f6417211df",
   "text": "让我们携手共创一个更健康、更幸福的世界。[[TAG_1]][[TAG_2]]此致敬礼，[[TAG_3]][[OPEN_4]]K.V. Ramesh[[TAG_5]][[CLOSE_4]]Kairali Ayurvedic Group董事总经理",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
